# Class: obo:PROMOT_0000015 (entidad anatómica relacionada con un fenotipo)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:PROMOT_0000015 "An anatomical entity related to a phenotype such that the anatomical entity is the location of the phenotype. In other words, the phenotype is a disposition of the anatomical entity."@en)
